OL,3,GNEWSAFirst female jet pilot opens new
OL,4,Aaviation school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain's first female fast jet pilot
OL,7,Freturned to the skies to launch a new
OL,8,Faviation academy that hopes to attract
OL,9,Fmore women to the industry.
OL,11,FDr Jo Salter officially opened the
OL,12,Facademy set up by Mission Aviation
OL,13,FFellowship (MAF) by piloting a Diamond
OL,14,FDA42 Twin star aircraft on Saturday,
OL,15,Fwhich was also marking Girls in
OL,16,FAviation Day, at Cranfield Airport in
OL,17,FBedfordshire.
OL,19,FMAF said it was concerned by figures
OL,20,Fshowing the global aviation industry
OL,21,Fwould need about 1.4 million new
OL,22,Fprofessionals by 2034.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
