OL,3,GNEWSAFirst female jet pilot opens new
OL,4,Aaviation school
OL,5,
OL,6,FSalter, who made history in 1992 when
OL,7,Fshe became the first British woman to
OL,8,Ffly a Tornado, said: "Seize the
OL,9,Fopportunities... just step out and give
OL,10,Fit a go, however scary it may feel."
